64	 * cross-surface question has actually been answered.
65	 *
66	 * @param {object} ev  the eight fields
67	 * @param {object} opts
68	 *   attemptedSignatures: paths already tried in earlier rounds (loop control)
69	 *   round: which exhaustion round this is
70	 */
